+class GridPatchDataset(IterableDataset):
+    """
+    Yields patches from images read from an input dataset. The patches are chosen in a contiguous grid sampling
+    scheme by a patch generator (such as :py:class:`PatchIter`), and each patch is optionally post-processed by a
+    per-patch transform. For example, with two single-channel 4x4 images:
+
